{{Quote|Use charming abilities to debuff enemies, and to summon your Besto Friendo.|Shop}}
'''Love''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|1,300,000}} or {{Robux|1,700}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]]. 

Love allows the user to conjure and manipulate pink, heart-shaped elements depicted as "Love" into attacks that can not only damage enemies, but also significantly reduce their attacking power. The user can also summon a "Besto Friendo" that will fight for them, or ride a pink flamingo and hover in the air.

