==Overview==
<tabber>
Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Excels in aerial combat.
* The Lovestruck passive can heavily distort and agitate the enemy, as it is not affected by disabling screen shake.
* All moves can [[Instinct/Break|break Instinct]].

|'''[Z] Heart Shot'''
* Decent damage.
* Good [[Area of Effect|AoE]].
* High range.

|'''[X] Cupid's Zone'''
* Extremely long range.
* Decent [[Area of Effect|AoE]].
* Can be deadly if used correctly in a combo.
* Completely disables movement abilities.

|'''[C] Irresistible Attraction '''
* Can pull enemies closer, making it really good for combos.
* Tap is very easy to combo extend
* Held is great to combo start.
* Decent [[Area of Effect|AoE]].
* Good vertical hitbox.

|'''[V] Besto Friendo'''
* Besto Friendo works as an independent entity, so its damage does not scale with the user's [[Blox Fruit|fruit]] stats. This is amazing for gun/sword mains that want to utilize Love.
* It uses the [[Canvander]] sword, a sword whose attacks break instinct.
* It can attack [[Blade]] users.

|'''[F] Flamingo Ride'''
* All moves can be used whilst flying.
* Very low cooldown.
* Can carry other players.
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Overall damage is quite low.

|'''[Z] Heart Shot'''
* High and sometimes unpredictable knockback, making it unreliable in grinding.

|'''[X] Cupid's Zone'''
* Low stun.
* Easy to dodge.

|'''[C] Irresistible Attraction '''
* Small hitbox.

|'''[V] Besto Friendo'''
* Aside from the ability to use Canvander's [Z] and [X] move while in the air, Besto Friendo is almost useless when fighting in the air.
* [[Elemental]] users are completely immune to their attacks.

|'''[F] Flamingo Ride'''
* While using this move, the user is unable to attack with any weapon.
* Flight speed scales with HP.
}}
</tabber>

