==Trivia==
* If the user has spawned a Friendo from Love's {{Ability|V}} and dies, the Friendo will die as well.
* The Friendo's [[health]] and damage scale off the user's current [[level]]. For example, their health is roughly the user's level multiplied by 2, and their M1 damage is user's level divided by roughly 1.65.
* Love was reworked in [[Updates/19|Update 19]], adding the new passive and increasing its value. 
* {{Ability|V}} uses the avatar of one of the user's Roblox friends, picked at random. Four friends are randomly selected for this role per server, meaning only four friends can be a Friendo per server.
* The flamingo on {{Ability|F}} wears the [[Heart Shades]] accessory.
* This fruit's X move used to have infinite range, but this has been changed.

